        "original_id": "03c9041d-24ce-536c-872e-5f1c1baa0bc5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: FC Bayern Munich, Juventus, Croatia national team, Bundesliga\n- People: Mario Mandžukić, Xherdan Shaqiri, Dante, Claudio Pizarro, Mitchell Weiser, Tom Starke\n- Seasons: 2012–13 FC Bayern Munich season, 1986–87 FC Bayern Munich season\n- Places: German football, Regionalliga Süd\n\nFacts:\n- FC Bayern Munich was promoted from the Regionalliga Süd in 1965 and then remained in the Bundesliga for 48 consecutive seasons through the 2012–13 season.\n- The 2012–13 FC Bayern Munich season was the club's 114th season in its history.\n- Before the 2012–13 season started, FC Bayern Munich signed Xherdan Shaqiri, Dante, Claudio Pizarro, Mitchell Weiser, Tom Starke, and Mario Mandžukić.\n- Mario Mandžukić was born on 21 May 1986.\n- Mario Mandžukić is a Croatian professional footballer who plays as a forward for Juventus and the Croatia national team.\n- A feat from the 1986–87 FC Bayern Munich season set two Bundesliga records that were not matched again until the 2012–13 season.",
